// Protocol state machine: idle → active → done.
//
// A simple protocol state machine that transitions between states based
// on events. Uses choice to handle different event types: either
// idle_to_active or active_to_done.
//
// Both transitions have True guarantees (no structural invariant beyond
// state validity), so the fixpoint converges with True as the invariant.
// The key property is that inference succeeds with zero annotations.
//
// Termination: Constant (side-channel; event stream passes through).

loop(comp(choice(arr("state.idle_to_active"), arr("state.active_to_done")), first(id)))
